        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our commitment to the well-being of our employees, we offer an external counselling service designed to assist employees with personal, family, or workplace matters.",
        "start_character": 41721,
        "end_character": 41897
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we manufactured more than 89% of our products in low-cost countries, including in seven manufacturing facilities in China, India, Mexico, Brazil, Romania and Slovakia.",
        "start_character": 21149,
        "end_character": 21325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In particular, we have already developed a full portfolio of fuel cell compressors, and we are in the pre-development phase with some of our customers for differentiated E-Powertrain and E-Cooling compressor solutions.",
        "start_character": 24906,
        "end_character": 25124
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The most significant raw materials we use to manufacture our products are grey iron, aluminum, stainless steel and a nickel-, iron- and chromium-based alloy.",
        "start_character": 26881,
        "end_character": 27038
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also working to broaden our portfolio with our Remanufactured (\"REMAN\") offering in Europe, the Middle East and Africa and North America which so far has increased our portfolio by over 400 additional applications, and at the same time provides the additional benefit of utilizing recovered parts while maintaining our required quality standards (by using original components and original assembly processes in our REMAN workshops).",
        "start_character": 16678,
        "end_character": 17117
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing solutions for zero-emission technologies for mobility and beyond, such as fuel cell compressors for a broad range of cell stack power (40kW to 250kW) and high-value electric products including E-Powertrain and E-Cooling compressor technologies, with approximately 50% of total RD&E spend focused on these new solutions.",
        "start_character": 18763,
        "end_character": 19100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We articulate our commitments to environmental, social and governance considerations in the communities in which we operate in our Code of Business Conduct, which can be found on our website at www.garrettmotion.com.",
        "start_character": 34683,
        "end_character": 34899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to develop our product range - including the introduction of our largest turbocharger, Garrett MEG - reinforcing our presence in marine and industrial applications, such as backup power generation for data centers.",
        "start_character": 14651,
        "end_character": 14877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect to continue to invest in product innovation and new technologies, and by leveraging our capabilities and expertise to develop selected offerings for electric vehicles, we believe that we are well positioned to remain a technology leader in the field of electrified vehicles.",
        "start_character": 24621,
        "end_character": 24905
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We maintain technical engineering centers in major automotive production regions of the world to develop and provide advanced products, processes and manufacturing support to all of our manufacturing sites, and to provide our customers with local engineering capabilities and design developments on a global basis.",
        "start_character": 25887,
        "end_character": 26201
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While no individual patent or group of patents, taken alone, is considered material to our business, taken in the aggregate, these patents provide meaningful protection for our intellectual property.",
        "start_character": 26671,
        "end_character": 26870
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001735707-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001735707-26-000009-cab0a88387102060",
        "accession_number": "0001735707-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
